{
    "title": "Tixr: Live Event Tickets",
    "description": "Browse concerts, music festivals, and sporting events to comedy shows, conventions, attractions, and more. Buy official tickets to the greatest live events on planet earth, while avoiding price gauging on the resale market. Manage, transfer, and upgrade purchases all in one place, and pull up tickets for quick mobile check-in. \r\n\r\nWith the Tixr app, you can:  \r\n\r\nBROWSE:\r\n- Search by event, artist, venue, or city near you and around the world\r\n- Explore tickets, reserved seats, available merch, travel packages, parking, and more\r\n- Select your seats from realistic venue maps before you buy\r\n\r\nBUY:\r\n- Get tickets in seconds and store cards securely for even faster checkout\r\n- Protect your orders to get a refund in case the unexpected happens\r\n- Enroll in payment plans to auto-pay in installments for qualifying purchases\r\n\r\nMANAGE:\r\n- See your complete order history\r\n- Transfer tickets to friends and family\r\n- Check for available upgrades and pay the difference\r\n\r\nACCESS:\r\n- Pull up QR codes in app for speedy check-in\r\n- Sync tickets to Google Wallet to pop up when you\u2019re close to the venue\r\n- View your media library and watch purchased videos on demand\r\n\r\nTRUST:\r\n- Always pay face value instead of being price gauged by scalpers and brokers\r\n- Protect yourself from fraud with verified tickets direct from the event creator\r\n\r\nFor account assistance or help with a recent Tixr purchase:\r\nYou can visit our FAQs 24/7 at support.tixr.com. For real human assistance, file a ticket with our Fan Support team at support.tixr.com/kb-tickets/new.\r\n\r\nConnect with us on socials:\r\nFacebook: @tixrhq\r\nInstagram: @tixrhq\r\nX: @tixr_\r\nLinkedIn: @tixr",
    "descriptionHTML": "Browse concerts, music festivals, and sporting events to comedy shows, conventions, attractions, and more. Buy official tickets to the greatest live events on planet earth, while avoiding price gauging on the resale market. Manage, transfer, and upgrade purchases all in one place, and pull up tickets for quick mobile check-in. <br><br>With the Tixr app, you can:  <br><br>BROWSE:<br>- Search by event, artist, venue, or city near you and around the world<br>- Explore tickets, reserved seats, available merch, travel packages, parking, and more<br>- Select your seats from realistic venue maps before you buy<br><br>BUY:<br>- Get tickets in seconds and store cards securely for even faster checkout<br>- Protect your orders to get a refund in case the unexpected happens<br>- Enroll in payment plans to auto-pay in installments for qualifying purchases<br><br>MANAGE:<br>- See your complete order history<br>- Transfer tickets to friends and family<br>- Check for available upgrades and pay the difference<br><br>ACCESS:<br>- Pull up QR codes in app for speedy check-in<br>- Sync tickets to Google Wallet to pop up when you\u2019re close to the venue<br>- View your media library and watch purchased videos on demand<br><br>TRUST:<br>- Always pay face value instead of being price gauged by scalpers and brokers<br>- Protect yourself from fraud with verified tickets direct from the event creator<br><br>For account assistance or help with a recent Tixr purchase:<br>You can visit our FAQs 24/7 at support.tixr.com. For real human assistance, file a ticket with our Fan Support team at support.tixr.com/kb-tickets/new.<br><br>Connect with us on socials:<br>Facebook: @tixrhq<br>Instagram: @tixrhq<br>X: @tixr_<br>LinkedIn: @tixr",
